<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5479/5489.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5479/5489.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5479/5489 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Friday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Saturday will be 5484.</p>
<p>On Thursday the bid/offer rates were 5476/5486, with the official dollar rate 5481 from Friday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>The daily corridor for the rouble on the interbank market is 5374/5974 after 5372/5972.</p>
</text>
